{
  "label": "Password & Keys",
  "category": "Personal Setting",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Tab: Password & Keys (Security Settings)",
      "id": "reset-password",
      "intro": "Tab **Password & Keys** digunakan untuk mengganti password akun pengguna secara aman. Form ini terdiri dari verifikasi password lama, input password baru dengan indikator kekuatan secara real-time, konfirmasi password, dan panel tips keamanan. Tombol **Update Password** hanya aktif jika semua validasi terpenuhi dan kekuatan password ≥ 50%.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Verifikasi Password Saat Ini",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Header**: Menampilkan judul *Security Settings* dengan ikon gembok dan badge indikator kekuatan password saat ini (dinamis: `Not set`, `Weak`, `Medium`, `Strong` dengan warna abu, merah, kuning, hijau).\n• **Seksi Verification**: Field **Current Password** *(Wajib)* — digunakan untuk memverifikasi identitas sebelum melakukan perubahan password. Menggunakan `PasswordInput` dengan toggle tampil/sembunyikan karakter. Validasi error ditampilkan di bawah field jika field disentuh namun dikosongkan.",
          "color": "#1e40af",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(30,64,175,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;padding:14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:#dbeafe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e40af\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Security Settings</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Update your password to keep your account protected.</div></div></div><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">● Not set</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;color:#2563eb;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:8px;\">Verification</div><div style=\"max-width:240px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:3px;\">Current Password <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:4px;\">Confirm your identity before making changes.</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:7px 8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#94a3b8;flex:1;\">Enter your current password</span><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17.94 17.94A10.07 10.07 0 0 1 12 20c-7 0-11-8-11-8a18.45 18.45 0 0 1 5.06-5.94\"/><path d=\"M9.9 4.24A9.12 9.12 0 0 1 12 4c7 0 11 8 11 8a18.5 18.5 0 0 1-2.16 3.19\"/></svg></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Indikator Kekuatan Password (Password Strength)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\nSaat pengguna mulai mengetik pada field **New Password**, panel kekuatan password muncul secara otomatis:\n• **Ring Progress**: Lingkaran progress menampilkan persentase kekuatan (0–100%) dengan label dan warna dinamis — merah (*Weak* < 50%), kuning (*Medium* 50–79%), hijau (*Strong* ≥ 80%).\n• **Requirements Checklist**: Menampilkan 5 persyaratan password dalam grid 2 kolom:\n  1. At least 8 characters\n  2. Uppercase letter (A–Z)\n  3. Lowercase letter (a–z)\n  4. Number (0–9)\n  5. Special character (!@#$…)\n• Setiap persyaratan yang terpenuhi ditandai dengan ikon centang hijau dan teks tebal. Yang belum terpenuhi ditampilkan dengan ikon silang abu.",
          "color": "#2563eb",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(30,64,175,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;padding:14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Password: <span style=\"color:#f59e0b;\">Medium</span></span><span style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#94a3b8;\">3/5 requirements</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#eff6ff);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:56px;height:56px;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"15.9155\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"15.9155\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"60 40\" stroke-dashoffset=\"25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#f59e0b;\">60%</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:6px;\">Requirements (3/5)</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"7\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">8+ characters</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"7\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Uppercase (A–Z)</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"7\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Lowercase (a–z)</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"7\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Number (0–9)</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"7\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Special char (!@#)</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "New Password, Confirm & Security Tips",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:3}\n• **New Password** *(Wajib)*: Input password baru. Dilengkapi dengan `PasswordMeter` yang memperbarui Ring Progress dan requirements checklist secara real-time.\n• **Confirm New Password** *(Wajib)*: Ulangi password baru untuk mencegah typo. Validasi error ditampilkan jika tidak cocok.\n• **Security Tips Panel**: Panel kuning di sisi kanan (hanya tampil di layar ≥ md) berisi 4 tips keamanan:\n  - Never reuse old passwords\n  - Don't share with anyone\n  - Use a password manager\n  - Enable 2FA for extra security\n• **Tombol Update Password**: Hanya aktif jika form valid dan kekuatan password ≥ 50%. Tombol **Reset Form** tersedia untuk mengosongkan semua field.",
          "color": "#1e40af",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "3": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(30,64,175,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;padding:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;color:#2563eb;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:8px;\">New Credentials</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"flex:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:2px;\">New Password <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid #2563eb;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#0f172a;flex:1;\">••••••••</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;display:flex;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#22c55e;\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#22c55e;\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#f59e0b;\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#e2e8f0;\"></div></div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:2px;\">Confirm New Password <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#94a3b8;\">Repeat new password</span></div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"13\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#92400e;\">Security Tips</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#fef3c7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#78350f;\">Never reuse old passwords</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#fef3c7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#78350f;\">Don't share with anyone</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#fef3c7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#78350f;\">Use a password manager</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#fef3c7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#78350f;\">Enable 2FA for extra security</span></div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;opacity:.5;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;\">Password changes are encrypted</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;\"><button style=\"padding:5px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#64748b;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">Reset Form</button><button style=\"padding:5px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#2563eb;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">Update Password</button></div></div></div>"
